# 2. Permissions We Use

Our App requests only the permissions necessary to provide its features.

### Exact Alarm Permissions

* SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM
* USE_EXACT_ALARM

Used to trigger alarms accurately even when the device is idle.

---

### RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED

Allows alarms to be restored after device restart.

---

### USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT

Displays the full-screen alarm interface while an alarm is ringing.

---

### POST_NOTIFICATIONS

Used to deliver alarm reminders and notifications.

---

### VIBRATE

Allows alarm vibration.

---

### WAKE_LOCK

Keeps the device awake while an alarm is ringing.

---

### MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS

Allows the App to control alarm volume and audio behavior.

---

### DISABLE_KEYGUARD

Allows alarms to appear over the lock screen.

---

### FOREGROUND_SERVICE

Used to ensure reliable alarm execution while the app is running.

---

### FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK

Allows alarm sounds to continue playing correctly.

---

### REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS

May be requested to improve alarm reliability on devices that aggressively restrict background activities.

---

### CAMERA

Allows users to capture photos for Secure Vault.

Camera access is optional.

---

### READ_MEDIA_IMAGES

Used to import photos into Secure Vault.

---

### READ_MEDIA_VIDEO

Used to import videos into Secure Vault.

---

### READ_MEDIA_AUDIO

Used to import audio files into Secure Vault.

---

### READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE

Used only on older Android versions to access user-selected media.

---

### WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE

Used only on older Android versions where required by Android.

---

### MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE

This permission is used solely to allow users to manage, import, organize, and protect their personal files inside the Secure Vault feature. We do not access files unrelated to the functionality selected by the user.

